  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YPuT73o.png\" alt=\"机械动力：点缀物语 Logo\" width=\"574\" height=\"190\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmmcreviews.com%252fall%252fmods%252fcreate-garnished%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/mmcreviews_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"MCC Reviews\" width=\"65\" height=\"64\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-garnished\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"65\" height=\"64\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/DakotaPride/create-garnished\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"65\" height=\"64\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8NkWwu9hgN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"65\" height=\"64\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.kinetichosting.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/57e54853825c80a1ccf03302564e00b3483d7e57.png\" alt=\"Kinetic Hosting\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a></p><p>支持 Fabric 和 NeoForge！</p><p><strong>如果您在寻找重制前版本（包含批量染色、花生油过热等功能）——<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/garnished\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">请点此处。</a></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>在《机械动力：点缀物语》的重制版本中，我采用了一套类似《农夫乐事》的野生作物系统，专门用于新增的花生和姜根。破坏野生作物会掉落花生或姜根；当然，使用精准采集附魔或剪刀可以获得野生作物本身，用于装饰或获取更高收益。此外，与野生姜根作物相关的新花卉——万寿菊也已加入，纯属装饰用途。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://create-garnished.github.io/images/blog/2025/wild_ginger_roots.png\" width=\"650\" height=\"365\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://create-garnished.github.io/images/blog/2025/wild_peanuts.png\" alt=\"野生花生\" width=\"650\" height=\"366\"></p><p>松子可以在针叶林及相关生物群系的云杉树顶找到。此外，您还可以发现一种新的甜浆果变种——精灵甜浆果，可用于制作特制的精灵茶！您很快就会注意到，1.21.x 的重制版本比起之前的版本，更侧重于茶叶加工和通用流体处理。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://create-garnished.github.io/images/blog/2025/pine_nut_trees.png\" width=\"650\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://create-garnished.github.io/images/blog/2025/elven_sweet_berries.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"366\"></p><p>繁花森林和向日葵平原现在会生成开花的杏树，您可以采集开花的杏树叶来获得杏仁！</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wEhvkOc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"339\"></p><p>白桦林和原始白桦林会有榛子树生成，您可以采集榛子树叶来获得榛子。与重制前一样，榛子可作为替代原料制作巧克力。此外，某些白桦树上会有桦树液从原木滴落，用空玻璃瓶右键点击即可收集，之后再加工成桦树糖浆。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kk3jO9c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"339\"></p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>贡献者/致谢</strong></h2><p><strong>《机械动力：点缀物语 重制版》在 DejojoTheAwsome 的视频《你在我的世界机械动力模组里需要这些坚果！》中亮相</strong></p><p><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4mrsel22FCw\" width=\"509\" height=\"285\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p><p><strong>《机械动力：点缀物语（重制版）》在 Shalz 的视频《最令人困惑的机械动力附属模组》（公平评价）中亮相</strong></p><p><strong><span><span><iframe style=\"width:509px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4o1l4ddbFDc\" width=\"509\" height=\"300\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@dejojotheawsome\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>DejojoTheAwsome</strong></a>&nbsp;<strong>- 概览视频 [v0.1.5.2]</strong></p><p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力开发团队</a> - 原始模组开发者与美术</strong></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>机械动力 Fabric 开发团队</strong></a>&nbsp;<strong>- Fabric 版模组开发者与美术</strong></p><h2><strong>可用版本</strong></h2><p><strong>Minecraft 1.21/1.21.1 - Fabric/Neoforge - 优先支持</strong></p><p><strong>Minecraft 1.20/1.20.1 - Fabric/Forge - Forge 版本可用，但当前不受支持</strong></p><h2><strong>1.21+ 依赖项</strong></h2><p><strong>Fabric 版本需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>（当前尚未完全支持 Fabric）</strong></p><p><strong>Neoforge 版本需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力 (Create)</a>（当前尚未完全支持 Fabric）</strong></p><p><strong>Neoforge 版本需要&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a>（当前尚未完全支持 Fabric）</strong></p>",
